Revoke_Vesting_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the caller is not the Captable's Safe
│   └── it should revert with OnlyBoard
├── when the grant does not exist
│   └── it should revert with UnknownGrant
├── when the grant is an offer that was not accepted
│   └── it should revert with NotAccepted
├── when it was already revoked
│   └── it should revert with AlreadyRevoked
├── when the effective date is in the past
│   └── it should revert with RevokeInPast
├── when nothing is locked at the effective date
│   ├── given the grant has fully vested
│   │   └── it should revert with FullyVested
│   └── given the grant fully vests before the effective date
│       └── it should revert with FullyVested
└── when the effective date is now or later and shares are locked then
    ├── it should record the revocation
    ├── given the effective date is now
    │   ├── it should burn the locked shares at once through the Captable
    │   └── it should emit RevocationSettled
    ├── given the effective date is in the future
    │   ├── it should keep vesting until then
    │   └── it should burn nothing yet
    └── it should emit Revoked
